# A resumed session whose turns ran tools and stopped (D1 follow-up): the
# toolgroup scenario's three turns -- every outcome form in one group, a call
# stopped at its approval, a command stopped while it runs -- then `/new` and
# the picker's resume of it. The live screens and the replay are snapped so
# the replay can be held to both the live group and upstream's replay, and
# Ctrl-O is paged to its top on both: the live record, then the replayed one.
fx: gateway toolgroup-fx.json
xfx: gateway toolgroup-xfx.json
work toolgroup-ws
fx: seed toolgroup-ask-settings.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 4
type look at the files and fix them
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap cmd-ask
key 1
wait 5
snap edit-ask
key 1
wait 2
snap write-ask
key 3
wait 2.5
snap exit-ask
key 1
wait 2.5
snap end
type and once more
key Enter
wait 2.5
key Escape
wait 1.5
snap again-stopped
type run the long one
key Enter
wait 2.5
key 1
wait 1.5
key C-c
wait 6
snap long-later
snapfull live
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap live-ctrl-o
key PPage
wait 0.5
snap live-ctrl-o-up1
key PPage
wait 0.5
snap live-ctrl-o-up2
key PPage
wait 0.5
snap live-ctrl-o-up3
key Escape
wait 1
type /new
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
type /resume
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap picker
key Enter
wait 3
snap resumed
snapfull resumed
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap ctrl-o
key PPage
wait 0.5
snap ctrl-o-up1
key PPage
wait 0.5
snap ctrl-o-up2
key Escape
wait 1
